      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Here's a draft error message for VaultFlow:\n\n\"Unfortunately, your transfer failed due to insufficient funds. Please review your account balance and try again once we detect sufficient funds. We're here to help and want to ensure your transactions are processed successfully. If you have any questions or concerns, feel free to reach out to our support team.\"\n\nI focused on providing clear and helpful information about the issue, while also offering reassurance and a point of contact for users to seek help.",
