      "content": "that's a good, safe start. it's professional. \n\nbut to be honest, it feels a little dry. the sentiment tool is giving that draft a pretty low score (around 0.4), and our design team really wants these notifications to feel more \"uplifting\" and \"friendly\" to reduce user anxiety. \n\ncould you try a few more versions? maybe try to raise that positivity score a bit more? just please keep it realistic—i'm serious about not wanting it to sound like a cheerleader or anything, just make it feel a bit warmer and more encouraging than the first one.",
